{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/31199-there-s-hope-yet","id":31199,"title":"There's hope yet!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-16T13:59:59-08:00","id":31199,"title":"There's hope yet!","content":"Just snagged <i>Blood &amp; Smoke</i> (it's fantastic, go get it) and there's a fair amount of space devoted to mini-settings; a brief supernatural history of the city being focused on, a rundown of who is important, and some small tasty hooks. I hope this is the format being used for the Seed collection, because it is lovely.<br /> <br /> But my main point is, the Berlin section has this neat gem:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> ...the numerous monuments to the victims of the Nazi Party attest to an older scar upon the psyche of the Kindred, many of whom remember the War and the strangers who entered afterwards, during the occupation. Late at night, they trade memories of foreign vampires and <b>clockwork devils</b>. Berlin has seen too much, and still wakes up covered in sweat in the middle of the night. </div> </div> </div>There's hope for Cold War Demon after all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T14:04:33-08:00","id":31205,"title":"","content":"No no <img src=\"http